Object.assign(window.HANDBOOK_EN,{"上午优先选择最想看的作品，09:30入场后暂按12:40–12:50离馆，给14:00午餐留60–70分钟交通预算。午餐地点确认后再调整。普通门票离馆后不能再次入场；未看完的内容可考虑14日另订门票再访，不默认原票可延用。": "Prioritise your most-wanted works in the morning. After 09:30 entry, provisionally leave at 12:40–12:50 for the 14:00 lunch, allowing 60–70 minutes for travel until the venue is known. Standard tickets do not permit re-entry. Consider a separate booking on 14 Nov for anything missed.", "11月13日14:00与纳卡午餐，时间已确定；地点及用餐时长待确认。": "Lunch with Sergei is confirmed for 14:00 on 13 Nov; the venue and duration are still to be confirmed.", "11月13日14:00已确定；地点与时长待确认。Maria是否参加尚未确认。": "Confirmed for 14:00 on 13 Nov. The venue and duration are still to be confirmed; Maria’s attendance is unconfirmed.", "14:00与Sergei午餐，地点待确认；歌剧前视午餐情况补充轻食。": "Lunch with Sergei at 14:00; venue to be confirmed. Have a light bite before the opera if needed.", "11/13 14:00与Sergei午餐已确定时间，地点待确认": "Lunch with Sergei is confirmed for 14:00 on 13 Nov; the venue is to be confirmed", "暂按12:40–12:50从卢浮宫离馆": "Provisionally leave the Louvre at 12:40–12:50", "13:50左右到约定地点": "Around 13:50 at the meeting point", "午餐14:00已确定；地址未知，60–70分钟交通仅为预算，地址确认后重算。": "Lunch is confirmed for 14:00. The venue is unknown; 60–70 minutes is only a travel allowance and must be recalculated once the address is confirmed.", "14:00": "14:00"});
